\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358880/extras/1c19e46d5d81c066b8bc279c1ffa7a15.poster.avif?t=1718141315\" width=590 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358880/extras/1c19e46d5d81c066b8bc279c1ffa7a15.webm?t=1718141315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><strong>Freedom is a matter of perspective</strong><br>In this near-future dystopia, the eerily familiar always-online society gives way to complete government control—all in the name of safety. But in the midst of it all, an insurgent group known as “Liberated” rises.<br><br><strong>Accolades</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>&quot;Looks like a noir graphic novel come to life&quot; - <strong>Game Informer</strong><br></li><li>&quot;There’s really something magical here&quot; - <strong>PC Invasion</strong><br></li><li>&quot;The story has echoes of <i>Watchmen</i>&quot; - <strong>PC Gamer</strong><br></li><li>“Blends noir comic art style with <i>Inside</i>-style-gameplay” - <strong>Polygon</strong><br></li><li>“Feels like an episode of <i>Black Mirror</i>” - <strong>The Sartorial Geek</strong></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358880/extras/23f0720a4d561320a2f3f66261399891.poster.avif?t=1718141315\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358880/extras/23f0720a4d561320a2f3f66261399891.webm?t=1718141315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1358880/extras/23f0720a4d561320a2f3f66261399891.mp4?t=1718141315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>This is a free sample of Liberated.<br></li><li>Witness a 